THE INCIDENT
On a cold October morning, five black SUVs arrived at Mark Longo's farm. What happened next would spark national outrage.

THE VICTIM
P'nut was no ordinary squirrel. He had millions of followers and represented something bigger than just a pet.

THE RAID
Agents spent hours searching the property. They claimed to be looking for animals, but their focus on the bedroom raised questions.

THE AFTERMATH  
Mark Longo lost more than a pet. The incident exposed deep divisions about government overreach and individual rights.

ACCESS AND MATERIALS
We have exclusive interviews with Mark, his attorney, and the officers involved. Never-before-seen security footage reveals what really happened.

VISUAL APPROACH
Dark, cinematic verite mixed with social media footage. The contrast between P'nut's joyful videos and the raid footage will be stark.
